=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683770/extras/c9401edc56d95e796fa63d9a3a3b363f.webm?t=1755449343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683770/extras/c9401edc56d95e796fa63d9a3a3b363f.mp4?t=1755449343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd75 <strong>Multiplayer Co-op Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the same bubble tea shop <strong>together with friends</strong>, divide tasks, or even fight over the prep station \ud83d\ude02.<br>More gameplay features and expansions are planned for the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683770/extras/ea20851bd960b34bed126613d3ba1607.poster.avif?t=1755449343\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683770/extras/ea20851bd960b34bed126613d3ba1607.webm?t=1755449343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683770/extras/ea20851bd960b34bed126613d3ba1607.mp4?t=1755449343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Smack Rude Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing an unreasonable customer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes\u2014you can literally bonk them with a stick if you choose to!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdd <strong>Custom Pricing List</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You set your own prices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell watermelon juice for \u00a59.9 or pearl milk tea for \u00a5199\u2014your market instincts will guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will react differently depending on your prices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>NPC Affection System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique NPCs with distinct personalities and preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has their own favorite bubble tea. Repeatedly interact and gift their favorite items to build relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach certain affection levels to unlock exclusive recipes or furniture blueprints!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddcd <strong>Diverse Customer Models</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From office workers, grandmas, and trendy teens to selfie-loving cat-eared girls\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their appearances are more expressive, and they bring more personalized demands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Player Character Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your character\u2019s appearance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to support customization for hairstyles, skin tones, aprons, accessories, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear a school uniform while selling tea or rock sunglasses as a villain boss\u2014anything goes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Popularity System &amp; Tip Mechanism</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better the service, the tastier the drinks, the more stylish your shop\u2014the higher the tips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even wealthy NPCs might give you generous surprise rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that a truly <i>relaxing and heartwarming</i> bubble tea game is more than just taking orders and selling drinks\u2014<br>it should be a slice-of-life simulation that\u2019s uniquely yours: chatting with NPCs, redesigning your shop, and running the business alongside friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cup of bubble tea might carry a story,<br>or simply reflect a feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683770/extras/e7d1bbf900a851f13eeab8d5b6ffc8f5.avif?t=1755449343\" width=800 height=533 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;With the warmth of one cup of tea, save a universe on the brink of sweet collapse.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click <strong>[Open for Business]</strong> now\u2014Icebao's tail is already spinning like a propeller! \ud83e\uddca\ud83c\udf00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683770/extras/3aa4982dc5c9491afdc318a00a5b2529.avif?t=1755449343\" width=300 height=257 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Reborn at my venture's start. Last life, poor management got my milk tea shop crushed by rivals. At the door, sweet milk scent hit me, fired me up. Now, &quot;Frost Citadel&quot; aims to haunt the milk tea world. With my friend, we\u2019ll set up to rule this street.",
